 2<sup>12</sup> &times; 3<sup>4</sup> &times; 7<sup>3</sup>.<br><br><b>Short Trick:</b><br>Decompose into primes:<br>1) 2<sup>2</sup> &times; 3<sup>4</sup> &times; 7<sup>2</sup><br>2) 2<sup>8</sup> &times; 3<sup>4</sup><br>3) 2<sup>12</sup> &times; 3<sup>2</sup> &times; 7<sup>3</sup><br>LCM = highest powers = 2<sup>12</sup> &times; 3<sup>4</sup> &times; 7<sup>3</sup>."
